WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:01.400
Here's what done looks like.

2
00:00:01.400 --> 00:00:06.300
The cross-source query names at least one
identity or cloud-app source each week.

3
00:00:06.300 --> 00:00:10.888
Every emergency access account in the
settings is an identity exclusion.

4
00:00:10.888 --> 00:00:14.687
Every device group is at the
ladder's level, or has an exception.

5
00:00:14.687 --> 00:00:18.275
Every exclusion has an approver
and a review date ahead.

6
00:00:18.275 --> 00:00:22.425
And every device runs a sensor at
or above the Contain User minimum.

7
00:00:22.425 --> 00:00:25.556
Next, Chapter 8 runs every
check in one command,

8
00:00:25.556 --> 00:00:30.500
computes the guide's metrics, and
records it all for the security officer.

9
00:00:30.500 --> 00:00:31.660
Thanks for watching.
